# Project Structure

Vite + React admin panel for the Binder multi-company platform. Consumes `binder_app_backend` (NestJS) at `VITE_API_URL`.

## Root Layout

```
binder_app_frontend/
├── src/                    # Application source (edit here)
├── dist/                   # Production build output — do not edit
├── public/                 # Static assets copied as-is (favicon.svg, icons.svg)
├── .cursor/rules/          # Cursor agent rules
├── compose.yaml            # Dev: node:20, port 3000
├── Dockerfile              # Multi-stage: node build → nginx serve
├── nginx.conf              # SPA fallback (try_files → index.html)
├── index.html              # HTML shell, script → /src/main.tsx
├── vite.config.ts          # Vite config, @ alias, dev port
├── .env.development        # Dev env vars (gitignored copy of .env.example)
├── .env.example            # Env template
├── package.json
├── tsconfig.json           # Project references root
├── tsconfig.app.json       # App TS config (src/)
└── tsconfig.node.json      # Vite config TS
```

## Entry Points

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `index.html` | HTML shell; mounts `#root`; loads `src/main.tsx` |
| `src/main.tsx` | React root: `createRoot`, `StrictMode`, renders `App` |
| `src/App.tsx` | App shell: `QueryClientProvider`, `ThemeProvider`, `CssBaseline` |
| `src/vite-env.d.ts` | Types for `import.meta.env` (`VITE_*`) |

